{"concepts":[{"conceptKey":"word.no.concept.9dbc6e9661b95d25","expressions":[],"labelZhHant":"沒有、不是或禁止","meaningLines":[{"meaningZhHant":"沒有；不具備任何……，放在名詞前表示零個或零量","partOfSpeech":"determiner"},{"meaningZhHant":"不是……；用在名詞前否定某人的身分或某事的性質","partOfSpeech":"determiner"},{"meaningZhHant":"禁止……；常見於告示，放在表示活動的名詞或動名詞前","partOfSpeech":"determiner"}],"phrases":[],"primaryExample":{"sentenceEn":"There is no milk in the fridge.","translationZhHant":"冰箱裡沒有牛奶。"},"priority":"primary","relations":[{"kind":"synonym","meaningZhHant":"零；數量為零","partOfSpeech":"numeral","spelling":"zero"},{"kind":"antonym","meaningZhHant":"一些；若干","partOfSpeech":"determiner","spelling":"some"}],"secondaryExamples":[{"sentenceEn":"I'm no expert, but I think this could work.","translationZhHant":"我不是專家，但我覺得這個方法可能行得通。"},{"sentenceEn":"The sign says “No smoking.”","translationZhHant":"告示上寫著「禁止吸菸」。"}]},{"conceptKey":"word.no.concept.e67c9a65c693c50a","expressions":[{"expression":"No way!","meaningZhHant":"絕不；不可能！"},{"expression":"No, thanks.","meaningZhHant":"不用了，謝謝。"}],"labelZhHant":"否定或拒絕","meaningLines":[{"meaningZhHant":"不；不是。用來給予否定回答、否認或拒絕","partOfSpeech":"interjection"}],"phrases":[],"primaryExample":{"sentenceEn":"“Are you coming?” “No, I’m staying home.”","translationZhHant":"「你要來嗎？」「不，我要待在家。」"},"priority":"primary","relations":[{"kind":"synonym","meaningZhHant":"不；才不要","partOfSpeech":"interjection","spelling":"nope"},{"kind":"antonym","meaningZhHant":"是；好","partOfSpeech":"interjection","spelling":"yes"}],"secondaryExamples":[]},{"conceptKey":"word.no.concept.c20a95d7cb3bc788","expressions":[],"labelZhHant":"否定回答","meaningLines":[{"meaningZhHant":"否定的回答或拒絕","partOfSpeech":"noun"}],"phrases":[],"primaryExample":{"sentenceEn":"Her answer was a clear no.","translationZhHant":"她明確地回答「不」。"},"priority":"secondary","relations":[{"kind":"synonym","meaningZhHant":"拒絕；不接受","partOfSpeech":"noun","spelling":"refusal"},{"kind":"antonym","meaningZhHant":"接受；同意","partOfSpeech":"noun","spelling":"acceptance"}],"secondaryExamples":[]},{"conceptKey":"word.no.concept.b812387e2f02dc87","expressions":[{"expression":"no longer","meaningZhHant":"不再"},{"expression":"no more","meaningZhHant":"不再；不再有更多"}],"labelZhHant":"一點也不；不再","meaningLines":[{"meaningZhHant":"一點也不；用於比較級前表示沒有更高的程度，也用於 no longer、no more 等片語表示不再","partOfSpeech":"adverb"}],"phrases":[],"primaryExample":{"sentenceEn":"This bag is no lighter than the other one.","translationZhHant":"這個袋子一點也不比另一個輕。"},"priority":"secondary","relations":[],"secondaryExamples":[{"sentenceEn":"She no longer lives here.","translationZhHant":"她已經不住在這裡了。"}]}],"confusables":[{"linkTarget":"word.know","spelling":"know"},{"linkTarget":"word.now","spelling":"now"}],"coreMeaningZhHant":"核心意思是「否定、沒有」：可以表示一樣也沒有，也可以直接回答「不」。","headwordExpressions":[{"examples":[{"sentenceEn":"“Can you help me?” “No problem.”","translationZhHant":"「你可以幫我嗎？」「沒問題。」"},{"sentenceEn":"“Thanks for your help.” “No problem.”","translationZhHant":"「謝謝你的幫忙。」「不客氣。」"}],"expression":"no problem","meaningZhHant":"沒問題；不客氣"},{"examples":[{"sentenceEn":"I'll support you no matter what happens.","translationZhHant":"無論發生什麼事，我都會支持你。"}],"expression":"no matter","meaningZhHant":"不論；無論"}],"ipa":"/noʊ/","irregularForms":[],"mainExample":{"conceptKey":"word.no.concept.9dbc6e9661b95d25","sentenceEn":"There is no milk in the fridge.","translationZhHant":"冰箱裡沒有牛奶。"},"meaningSummary":[{"meaningZhHant":"沒有；不是；禁止","partOfSpeech":"determiner"},{"meaningZhHant":"不；不是；拒絕","partOfSpeech":"interjection"},{"meaningZhHant":"否定回答；拒絕","partOfSpeech":"noun"},{"meaningZhHant":"一點也不；不再","partOfSpeech":"adverb"}],"morphology":null,"schemaVersion":"learner-card-vnext/4","word":"no","wordFamily":[]}
